{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e12-scene-06",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "胃还好吗等你回来庆功  (How Is Your Stomach? Celebrate When You Return)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "wen_simo": "闻思默",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "On the Twelve Singers stage, host Wen Simo unveils Xin Huimei's mysterious wild-card duet to soaring live ratings. Late that night, Chun Yuqiao phones Xingtian's office from abroad—and Bu Xiaogu, still working alone, picks up. Listen to Wen Simo, Xiaogu, and Chun Yuqiao in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "十二歌王第三季，辛惠美战队的首秀即将登场！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "辛惠美在第一支竞演曲目里，启用了神秘的外卡队员与她同场演出。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "连我们其他战队的导师，都不知道她的真实身份。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "下面这首歌曾经在中国的流行乐史上留下过浓重的一笔，请欣赏！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "喂，您好，星天总编室。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "一切都还好吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "是您？我挺好的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "工作一切还好吗？你们也不联系我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "工作上没什么特别的事情发生，就是十二歌王有一件事情我觉得有点不妥。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "什么情况？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "但是收视效果非常好。您还好吗，吃得好不好，胃还好吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "没事。好。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "十二歌王第三季，辛惠美战队的首秀即将登场！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In Season Three of Twelve Singers, Team Xin Huimei's debut performance is about to take the stage!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "辛惠美在第一支竞演曲目里，启用了神秘的外卡队员与她同场演出。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'For her very first competition song, Xin Huimei has brought in a mysterious wild-card singer to perform alongside her.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "连我们其他战队的导师，都不知道她的真实身份。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Not even the mentors of our other teams know this singer's true identity.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "下面这首歌曾经在中国的流行乐史上留下过浓重的一笔，请欣赏！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This next song left a vivid mark on Chinese pop music history — please enjoy!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "喂，您好，星天总编室。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello, Xingtian chief editor's office.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "一切都还好吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is everything going well back there?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "是您？我挺好的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It's you? I'm doing well.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "工作一切还好吗？你们也不联系我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is the work going smoothly? None of you have reached out to me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "工作上没什么特别的事情发生，就是十二歌王有一件事情我觉得有点不妥。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Nothing unusual happened at work, except there was one detail on Twelve Singers that felt slightly off to me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "什么情况？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What happened?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "但是收视效果非常好。您还好吗，吃得好不好，胃还好吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Though the broadcast ratings were phenomenal! Are you doing okay — eating well, and how is your stomach?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "没事。好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My stomach is fine. Good.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "十二歌王第三季，辛惠美战队的首秀即将登场！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "辛惠美在第一支竞演曲目里，启用了神秘的外卡队员与她同场演出。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "连我们其他战队的导师，都不知道她的真实身份。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "下面这首歌曾经在中国的流行乐史上留下过浓重的一笔，请欣赏！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "喂，您好，星天总编室。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "一切都还好吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "是您？我挺好的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "工作一切还好吗？你们也不联系我。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "工作上没什么特别的事情发生，就是十二歌王有一件事情我觉得有点不妥。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "什么情况？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "但是收视效果非常好。您还好吗，吃得好不好，胃还好吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "没事。好。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Swallowing her misgivings about the song choice because the premiere ratings were historic, Xiaogu asks gently after Yuqiao's stomach and tells him the team awaits his return. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
